            representing the generator of the 4th
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+group"} homotopy group
            of
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
