              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/action"} action
              on reduced 1-Cohomotopy is always trivial:
            %p
              Now, the action of
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi n
                    %mo ∈
                    %msub
                      %mi π
                      %mn 1
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %msup
                      %mi S
                      %mn 1
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} n \in \pi_1(S^1)
              takes
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo{:maxsize => "1.2em", :minsize => "1.2em"} [
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
