            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/iterated+based+loop+space"} iterated based loop space
            of the
            = succeed ")," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/n-sphere"} D-sphere
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
                      %mi ℝ
                      %mi D
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{R}^D
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/charge"} charge
            to their total
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/charge"} charge
            as measured in
            = succeed "-" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cohomotopy"} Cohomotopy
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/generalized+cohomology"} cohomology theory
            (
            %a{:href => "Cohomotopy+charge#Segal73"}> Segal 73, Section 3
            ).
          %p
            This has evident generalizations to other manifolds than just Euclidean spaces, to spaces of labeleed configurations and to
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivariant+Cohomotopy"} equivariant Cohomotopy
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/G-space"} G-space
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/tori"} tori
            for
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi G
                  %mo =
                  %msub
                    %mi ℤ
                    %mn 2
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} G = \mathbb{Z}_2
            with values in
            = succeed "-" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi ℤ
                      %mn 2
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{Z}_2
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivariant+Cohomotopy"} equivariant Cohomotopy
          %center
            %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/pdf/1909.12277.pdf#page=24"}
              %img{:src => "https://ncatlab.org/schreiber/files/EquivariantCohomotopyTadpoleCancellationN.jpg", :width => "700"}/
          %blockquote
            %p
              graphics grabbed from
              %a{:href => "#SatiSchreiber19"} SS 19
          %p
            In some situations the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cohomotopy+charge+map"} Cohomotopy charge map
            is a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/weak+homotopy+equivalence"} weak homotopy equivalence
            and hence exhibits, for all purposes of
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+theory"} homotopy theory
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cohomotopy"} Cohomotopy
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cocycle+space"} cocycle space
            of Cohomotopy charges as an equivalent reflection of the
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/configuration+space+of+points"} configuration space of points
          #GroupCompletionOfConfigurationSpaceIsIteratedBasedLoopSpace.num_prop
            %h6#proposition_2 Proposition
            %p
              %strong
                (
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/group+completion"} group completion
                on
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/configuration+space+of+points"} configuration space of points
                is
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/iterated+based+loop+space"} iterated based loop space
            %p
              The
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cohomotopy+charge+map"} Cohomotopy charge map
              %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:CohomotopyChargeMapOnEuclideanSpace"} (3)
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi Conf
                    %mo{:maxsize => "1.2em", :minsize => "1.2em"} (
                    %msup
                      %mi ℝ
                      %mi D
                    %mo{:maxsize => "1.2em", :minsize => "1.2em"} )
                    %mover
                      %mo ⟶
                      %mi cc
                    %msup
                      %mi Ω
                      %mi D
                    %msup
                      %mi S
                      %mi D
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"}
                    Conf
                    \\big(
                    \\mathbb{R}^D
                    \\big)
                    \\overset{
                    cc
                    }{\longrightarrow}
                    \\Omega^D S^D
            %p
              from the full unordered and unlabeled configuration space (
              %a{:href => "configuration+space+of+points#eq:UnorderedUnlabeledConfigurationSpace"}> here
              ) of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Euclidean+space"} Euclidean space
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
                      %mi ℝ
                      %mi D
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{R}^D
              to the
              = succeed "-fold" do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi D
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} D
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/iterated+based+loop+space"} iterated based loop space
              of the
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/n-sphere"} D-sphere
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/group+completion"} group completion
              (
              %a{:href => "configuration+space+of+points#eq:GroupCompletionOfConfigurationSpaceMonoid"}> here
              ) of the configuration space monoid
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi Ω
                    %msub
                      %mi B
                      %mrow
                        %msub
                          %mrow
                          %mo ⊔
                        %mspace{:width => "negativethinmathspace"}
                    %mi Conf
                    %mo{:maxsize => "1.2em", :minsize => "1.2em"} (
                    %msup
                      %mi ℝ
                      %mi D
                    %mo{:maxsize => "1.2em", :minsize => "1.2em"} )
                    %mover
                      %mo ⟶
                      %mo ≃
                    %msup
                      %mi Ω
                      %mi D
                    %msup
                      %mi S
                      %mi D
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"}
                    \\Omega B_{{}_{\sqcup}\!}
                    Conf
                    \\big(
                    \\mathbb{R}^D
                    \\big)
                    \\overset{
                    \\simeq
                    }{\longrightarrow}
                    \\Omega^D S^D
          %p
            (
            %a{:href => "Cohomotopy+charge#Segal73"}> Segal 73, Theorem 1
            )
          #CohomotopyChargeMapIsEquivalenceOnSPhereLabeledConfihgurationSpace.num_prop
            %h6#proposition_3 Proposition
            %p
              %strong
                (
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cohomotopy+charge+map"} Cohomotopy charge map
                is
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/weak+homotopy+equivalence"} weak homotopy equivalence
                on sphere-labeled
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/configuration+space+of+points"} configuration space of points
            %p
              For
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi D
                    %mo ,
                    %mi k
                    %mo ∈
                    %mi ℕ
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} D, k \in \mathbb{N}
              with
              = succeed "," do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi k
                      %mo ≥
                      %mn 1
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} k \geq 1
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cohomotopy+charge+map"} Cohomotopy charge map
              %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:CohomotopyChargeMapOnEuclideanSpace"} (3)
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi Conf
                    %mo{:maxsize => "1.2em", :minsize => "1.2em"} (
                    %msup
                      %mi ℝ
                      %mi D
                    %mo ,
                    %msup
                      %mi S
                      %mi k
                    %mo{:maxsize => "1.2em", :minsize => "1.2em"} )
                    %munderover
                      %mo ⟶
                      %mo ≃
                      %mi cc
                    %msup
                      %mi Ω
                      %mi D
                    %msup
                      %mi S
                      %mrow
                        %mi D
                        %mo +
                        %mi k
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"}
                    Conf
                    \\big(
                    \\mathbb{R}^D,
                    S^k
                    \\big)
                    \\underoverset{\simeq}{cc}{\longrightarrow}
                    \\Omega^D S^{D + k}
            %p
              is a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/weak+homotopy+equivalence"} weak homotopy equivalence
              from the configuration space (
              %a{:href => "configuration+space+of+points#eq:UnorderedLabeledCOnfigurationSpace"}> here
              ) of unordered points with labels in
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
                      %mi S
                      %mi k
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} S^k
              and vanishing at the base point of the label space to the
              = succeed "-fold" do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi D
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} D
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/iterated+loop+space"} iterated loop space
              of the
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/n-sphere"} D+k-sphere
          %p
            (
            %a{:href => "Cohomotopy+charge#Segal73"}> Segal 73, Theorem 3
            )
          %p
            The May-Segal theorem
            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#ScanningMapEquivalenceOverCartesianSpace"}
            generalizes from
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Euclidean+space"} Euclidean space
            to
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/closed+manifold"} closed
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/smooth+manifolds"} smooth manifolds
            if at the same time one passes from plain
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cohomotopy"} Cohomotopy
            to
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/twisted+Cohomotopy"} twisted Cohomotopy
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/J-homomorphism"} J-homomorphism
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/tangent+bundle"} tangent bundle
          #ScanningMapEquivalenceOverClosedManifold.num_prop
            %h6#proposition_4 Proposition
            %p Let
            %ol
              %li
                %p
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %msup
                          %mi X
                          %mi n
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X^n
                  be a
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/smooth+manifold"} smooth
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/closed+manifold"} closed manifold
                  of
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/dimension"} dimension
                  = succeed ";" do
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mi n
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} n
              %li
                %p
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mn 1
                        %mo ≤
                        %mi k
                        %mo ∈
                        %mi ℕ
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} 1 \leq k \in \mathbb{N}
                  a
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/positive+number"} positive
                  = succeed "." do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/natural+number"} natural number
            %p
              Then the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cohomotopy+charge+map"} Cohomotopy charge map
              constitutes a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/weak+homotopy+equivalence"} weak homotopy equivalence
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %munder
                      %mrow
                        %msub
                          %mi Maps
                          %mrow
                            %msub
                              %mrow
                              %mrow
                                %mo{:stretchy => "false"} /
                                %mi B
                                %mi O
                                %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                                %mi n
                                %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                        %mo{:maxsize => "1.8em", :minsize => "1.8em"} (
                        %msup
                          %mi X
                          %mi n
                        %mspace{:width => "thickmathspace"}
                        %mo ,
                        %mspace{:width => "thickmathspace"}
                        %msup
                          %mi S
                          %mrow
                            %msub
                              %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                                %mi n
                              %mi def
                            %mo +
                            %msub
                              %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                                %mi k
                              %mi{:mathvariant => "normal"} triv
                        %mspace{:width => "negativethinmathspace"}
                        %mo ⫽
                        %mspace{:width => "negativethinmathspace"}
                        %mi O
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                        %mi n
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                        %mo{:maxsize => "1.8em", :minsize => "1.8em"} )
                      %mstyle{:mathcolor => "blue"}
                        %mfrac{:linethickness => "0"}
                          %mrow
                            %mphantom
                              %mi a
                          %mrow
                            %mtext J-twisted Cohomotopy space
                    %munderover
                      %mo ⟵
                      %mo ≃
                      %mstyle{:mathcolor => "blue"}
                        %mtext Cohomotopy charge map
                    %munder
                      %mrow
                        %mi Conf
                        %mo{:maxsize => "1.2em", :minsize => "1.2em"} (
                        %msup
                          %mi X
                          %mi n
                        %mo ,
                        %msup
                          %mi S
                          %mi k
                        %mo{:maxsize => "1.2em", :minsize => "1.2em"} )
                      %mpadded{:lspace => "-50%width", :width => "0"}
                        %mstyle{:mathcolor => "blue"}
                          %mfrac{:linethickness => "0"}
                            %mrow
                              %mphantom
                                %mi a
                            %mrow
                              %mfrac{:linethickness => "0"}
                                %mrow
                                  %mtext configuration space
                                %mrow
                                  %mtext of points
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"}
                    \\underset{
                    \\color{blue}
                    { \phantom{a} \atop \text{ J-twisted Cohomotopy space}}
                    }{
                    Maps_{{}_{/B O(n)}}
                    \\Big(
                    X^n
                    \\;,\;
                    S^{
                    \\mathbf{n}_{def} + \mathbf{k}_{\mathrm{triv}}
                    }
                    \\!\sslash\!
                    O(n)
                    \\Big)
                    }
                    \\underoverset
                    {\simeq}
                    {
                    \\color{blue}
                    \\text{Cohomotopy charge map}
                    }
                    {\longleftarrow}
                    \\underset{
                    \\mathclap{
                    \\color{blue}
                    {
                    \\phantom{a}
                    \\atop
